{"id":"steam-823210","steam":823210,"igdb":null,"type":"game","title":"Lunar Soil","summary":"Lunar Soil is a third-person science-fiction game that will take you on a journey of exploration and discovery. Set in a mysterious and atmospheric world, you will have to solve challenging puzzles and unravel the secrets of abandoned bunkers and mysterious puzzle towers.","about":"Lunar Soil\n\r\n\r\n\nExploration\n\r\nLunar Soil is a third-person science-fiction game that will take you on a journey of exploration and discovery. Set in a mysterious and atmospheric world, you will have to solve challenging puzzles and unravel the secrets of abandoned bunkers and mysterious puzzle towers.\r\n\r\n\r\n\nDiscovery\n\r\nWith beautiful graphics and a subtle story-line, Lunar Soil offers a unique and engaging gameplay experience. As you explore the desolate landscapes of this alien world, you will uncover hidden artifacts and clues that will help you uncover the truth behind Lunar Soil.\r\n\r\n\r\n\nPuzzle-solving\n\r\nLunar Soil focuses on exploration and puzzle-solving, rather than combat. This makes it a perfect game for players who enjoy a more relaxed and cerebral gameplay experience.\r\n\r\n\r\nIn Lunar Soil, you will have to use your wits and your abilities to navigate through the game's challenging environments. From dark and eerie bunkers to towering alien structures, you will have to overcome obstacles and solve puzzles to progress through the game.\r\n\r\n\r\nWith its unique setting and engaging gameplay, Lunar Soil is a must-play for fans of science-fiction and puzzle games. So why not give it a try and see if you have what it takes to uncover the secrets of this mysterious world?\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nLunar Soil is still in-development join the active playtests and the .\r\n\r\nFollow the game on steam for updates.","cover":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/823210/library_600x900.jpg?t=1735210716","coverFallback":"https://shared.akam